 * Pulse tests (ISC-40..44).
 *
 * Three layers:
 *   1. Pure projection math (tiles A/B/C, as-of stamps) over fixtures.
 *   2. StorePulseSource deriving raw state through the Store interface.
 *   3. End-to-end runPulseJob writing the widget JSON to a known path.
 */

